# VCS / metadata
.git
.gitignore
.turbo

# Dependencies & build output (rebuilt inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/src/generated

# Environment / secrets — never part of the build context
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Test & report artifacts
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/*.log
